    "description": "Unmada Vara: The Pulse of Prāṇa\n\nLast time, we stepped into the blessing of madness — into intensity, into letting go, into something raw and real.\n\nThis time, we go deeper.\n\nThe Pulse of Prāṇa is about the life-force that moves through everything — through sound, through people, through moments that stay with you long after they pass. It’s not about escaping… It’s about feeling more. Being more present. More alive.\n\nUnmada Vara has always been about coming together with intention — not just to celebrate, but to reset, reconnect, and return to something real within ourselves.\n\nThis New Year’s, we gather again — for that shared pulse you can’t quite explain, only feel.\n\nTickets are now live on all platforms.\n\nTier 2 is priced at INR 4,000/-.\n\nThe line-up, as always, will never disappoint — worth the wait. Announcements coming soon.\n\nWe come together on 31st December 2026 into 1st January 2027 for a New Year’s Eve gathering to reset mind, body, and soul.\n\nLocation: Goa Venue: To be announced\n\nMore details soon",
