    "name": "Perseverance Festival",
    "slug": "perseverance-goa",
    "description": "Psyrituals , Akkadian Project Presents - Perseverance Festival\n\n 📆 26 - 28 December 2026\n\nVENUE -📍 D Pedro , Goa\n\nPERSEVERANCE FESTIVAL\n26th - 27th December 2026 • Goa\n\nIn Collaboration with @_akkadianproject & @psyrituals.records\n\nThe time has come to start a new chapter.\n\nDedicated to the details that matter most — a precisely engineered sound system, where artists who have persevered with their craft for decades and more will weave conceptual music into a journey that transcends us to the core of our inner beings.\n\nWith visionary art that connects us to higher subtle dimensions, sacred fire performances to ignite our inner flame and reveal our path of self-discovery…\n\nPerseverance Festival is for the dreamers, the wanderers, the seekers, and the visionaries — for those who walk the edge between worlds, who hear the call of the wild jungle and the pulse of the cosmos, who refuse to dim their inner light.\n\nIt is a sanctuary for the souls brave enough to surrender, to dance through the shadows and the stars, to dissolve the boundaries between self and universe.\n\nLet the fire awaken ancient truths. Let the visions guide you home.\n\nUnder the same eternal sky, we endure. We transform. We rise.\n\nThis is Perseverance.\n\nVenue: @dpedroinn Mandrem, Goa\n\n⚡ SUPER EARLY BIRD IS LIVE — Only first 40 tickets at the lowest price.\nOnce they’re gone, the price rises.\n\nGrab yours now before they disappear:",
